ches and starry nights to mountain summits, a painted valley and outer space\n\u2022 Passthrough mode: practice with the shapes floating in your own room\n\u2022 Adjustable shapes, ambient soundscapes and a practice timer\n\u2022 Gentle practice tips that unlock as you keep practicing\n\nAbout the Tables\nAdditional info about meditating with the tables of chartres can be found online. The developer does not provide any.", "short_description": "Practice the Tables of Chartres in calm, immersive VR. Relax your gaze, let the shapes merge, and find a quiet, focused stillness."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spaceout-guild.github.io/datenschutz", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spaceout Guild", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spaceout-guild.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1346510905223367"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1670896798114336"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1670896798114336"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795468380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1670896798114336"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1357631437444647", "version": "1.3"}, "id": "1130416053033